OL,3,AAmazon rigged $20bn worth of ad prices,
OL,4,AUS lawsuit alleges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmazon secretly overcharged more than a
OL,7,Fmillion advertising customers by
OL,8,Fmanipulating online auctions it uses to
OL,9,Fset ad prices, according to a lawsuit
OL,10,Ffiled by the US Federal Trade
OL,11,FCommission (FTC) and a bipartisan group
OL,12,Fof 22 states.
OL,14,FAccording to the lawsuit, filed on
OL,15,FMonday, the alleged scheme has likely
OL,16,Fnetted the firm $20bn (#14.8bn) from
OL,17,Fadvertising customers since 2019.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
