CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788294016
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AI've been to Gamescom six times -
OL,4,Ahere's what excited me this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year that number of attendees is
OL,7,Fexpected to have been even bigger, with
OL,8,Fthe likes of Xbox and Sega showcasing
OL,9,Fgames to the public alongside indie
OL,10,Fstudios with only one or two
OL,11,Fdevelopers.
OL,13,FThis was my sixth time attending
OL,14,FGamescom, which never fails to make me
OL,15,Fexcited about the games industry. Here
OL,16,Fare a few of the big things I got to
OL,17,Fcheck out this week.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
