OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFans aim for Vulcan salute record on
OL,4,AStar Trek Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of Star Trek fans are set to
OL,7,Fgather at London's Science Museum to
OL,8,Ftry and set the Guinness World Record
OL,9,Ffor the largest simultaneous Vulcan
OL,10,Fsalute.
OL,12,FThe gesture, made famous by Leonard
OL,13,FNimoy's character Spock, involves
OL,14,Fraising the hand with the middle and
OL,15,Fring fingers parted. It first appeared
OL,16,Fin a 1967 episode of the TV series.
OL,18,FThe record attempt will take place on 8
OL,19,FSeptember, known amongst fans as Star
OL,20,FTrek Day.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788294016
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFans aim for Vulcan salute record on
OL,4,AStar Trek Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlyn Morgan, principal curator at the
OL,7,Fmuseum, said: "For 60 years, Star Trek
OL,8,Fhas connected bold storytelling with
OL,9,Fbig questions about science, technology
OL,10,Fand what might be possible in the
OL,11,Ffuture, themes that sit at the heart of
OL,12,Fthe Science Museum."
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
